From 6165c15540b5d8b8ff11edb6a569a7872615fe5a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 15:05:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(desktop/kanban): Blocked group header opens its chat on
 that chat's own gateway [daveey]

/session-labels returns the answering backend's profile; a group whose
managing chat lives on another gateway opens through host.openSession with
an owner route (connection + profile), the same owner a cross-gateway
sidebar row resumes through.
